   "w": 896,
   "h": 158,
   "html": "<h3>For my final project, I plan to use the MPM to simulate tomato sauce pouring from a pot into a bowl. Before starting the project, I&rsquo;ve identified several key considerations. The first is accurately representing the viscosity of the tomato sauce, as it plays a crucial role in how the fluid moves and interacts with the environment. Additionally, I need to account for the presence of tomato chunks within the sauce, which introduces complexity in the simulation due to their interaction with the fluid and the bowl.</h3>",
